From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MinsOS <minsos@local>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 01:00:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Guard a short perso status response (One UI 9, y2q)

UiccProfile event 110 (EVENT_GET_PERSO_STATUS_COMPLETE) answers the OEM_HOOK_RAW
04 01 000A 01 02 "0000" query that getIccUsimPersoStatus() sends on a Korean sales
code. It reads data[0] and data[1] with no length check. The SM-G986N A13 RIL
answers it with success and zero bytes, so com.android.phone threw
ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException length=0 at every SIM load and RescueParty warm
rebooted the phone. A result shorter than two bytes now takes the same exit as a
null result: log and leave mPersoSimLock unchanged (the exception path also
leaves it unchanged; event 111, the other perso query, already rejects an empty
array as "Bogus").
---
diff --git a/smali/com/android/internal/telephony/uicc/UiccProfile$5.smali b/smali/com/android/internal/telephony/uicc/UiccProfile$5.smali
--- a/smali/com/android/internal/telephony/uicc/UiccProfile$5.smali
+++ b/smali/com/android/internal/telephony/uicc/UiccProfile$5.smali
@@ -445,6 +445,12 @@
 
     check-cast p1, [B
 
+    array-length v0, p1
+
+    const/4 v1, 0x2
+
+    if-lt v0, v1, :minsos_perso_short
+
     iget-object v0, p0, Lcom/android/internal/telephony/uicc/UiccProfile$5;->this$0:Lcom/android/internal/telephony/uicc/UiccProfile;
 
     new-instance v1, Ljava/lang/StringBuilder;
@@ -495,6 +501,15 @@
 
     return-void
 
+    :minsos_perso_short
+    iget-object p0, p0, Lcom/android/internal/telephony/uicc/UiccProfile$5;->this$0:Lcom/android/internal/telephony/uicc/UiccProfile;
+
+    const-string p1, "EVENT_GET_PERSO_STATUS_COMPLETE short result, perso lock unchanged"
+
+    invoke-static {p0, p1}, Lcom/android/internal/telephony/uicc/UiccProfile;->-$$Nest$mloge(Lcom/android/internal/telephony/uicc/UiccProfile;Ljava/lang/String;)V
+
+    return-void
+
     :pswitch_6
     iget-object p1, p0, Lcom/android/internal/telephony/uicc/UiccProfile$5;->this$0:Lcom/android/internal/telephony/uicc/UiccProfile;
 
